| @Jasmijn Tsang - check if it’s a duplicate  Deferred to Phase 2 |\n| SFCC-18490f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | PLP |  | Deferred to Phase 2 |  | Confirmed with @Jasmijn Tsang @Bianca Morley  Deferred to Phase 2 |\n| SFCC-72490f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | SEO & Analytics & AB Testing | BA - 2 days  FED - 5 days  BED - @Victor T. Crisostomo  Testing - @Krizel B. Bartolome @Joseph Molina | Approved pending prioritisation |  | @Dani Rivett 's commentary on the ticket: “ The content team are really keen to be able to have this feature to execute numerous SEO requests and to build long-term page rankings for popular searches.” |\n| SFCC-80490f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Payments | BA - 1 day  Design - 0.5 day  FED - 2 days  BED - 2 days  Testing - 2 days |  |  | Under shipping and on top of payments  Deferred to Phase 2 |\n| SFCC-85090f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Product Catalogue | BA - 0.5 day  BED - 2 days  Testing - 2 days |  |  | Raised as high  Note: PoC or Tech Spike required  Tash to investigate |\n| SFCC-85790f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | SEO, Analytics & AB Testing | BA - 1 day  FED - 3 days  BED - 3 days (need to create customer end points)  Testing - 3 days |  |  | Need to inform Emarsys - a candidate we would recommend bringing in  Tash to investigate (following previous conversation with TNL) |\n| SFCC-85890f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Client Services | BA - 1 day  Design - .5 day (only if custom design on top)  FED - 3 days  Testing - 3 days |  |  | *Is this functionality available today? Assuming InsideChat has this functionality and SFCC to configure to activate?*  Defer to future phase |\n| SFCC-85990f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Checkout | BA - 1 day  FED - 5 days  Testing - 3 days | Approved | SFCC-79790f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Raised as high    Design - copy change    **Recommend we take this on** |\n