tail rewards does not need to be in scope.  Pegged for future phase. |\n| SFCC-95190f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Promotions | N/A | N/A - Global-E item. |  |  |\n| SFCC-94590f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Contentful | TBC |  |  |  |\n| SFCC-86290f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Wishlist | BA - 1 day  TBC |  |  | @Jasmijn Tsang to check with Emma on the latest information (ticket was created  )  Pegged for future phase (as long as we DO NOT have open pixel tracking) |\n| SFCC-68390f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Search |  | BA: 0.5 |  | @Victor T. Crisostomo  @Krizel B. Bartolome @Joseph Molina  Descoped |\n| SFCC-68590f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Search |  |  |  | @Victor T. Crisostomo  @Krizel B. Bartolome @Joseph Molina  Descoped |\n| SFCC-72290f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Search |  |  |  | @Victor T. Crisostomo  @Krizel B. Bartolome @Joseph Molina  Descoped |\n| SFCC-95290f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | Search |  |  |  | Close - confirmed with Bianca that it is a duplicate. |\n| Data Anonymisation?? (Emma/Jas) |  |  |  |  |  |\n\nEnhancement Capacity\n--------------------\n\nWe have 2 sprints of Enhancements capacity, equivalent to 20 business days. With four disciplines involved — 1 x BA, 1 x FED, 1 x BED, and 1 x Testing — this gives us a combined total of 80 business days.\n\nTo date the following amount has been approved by Zimmermann team and consumed:\n\n|  | **BA** | **FED** | **DEV** | **QA** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| SFCC-15590f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | 0.5 days | 1 day | 1 day | 2 days |\n| SFCC-14390f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | 0.5 days | 2 days | 2 days | 2 days |\n| SFCC-14290f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | 1 day | 3.5 days | 3.5 days | 2 days |\n| SFCC-13390f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | 0.5 days | 3 days | 3 days | 3 days |\n| SFCC-17390f39d3a-944a-3fa5-a6e7-595259a51237System Jira | 0.5 days | 3 days | N/A | 3 days |\n| **Total Consumed as of** | 3 days | 12.5 days | 9.5 days | 12 days |\n| **Total Remaining** | 17 days | 7.5 days | 10.5 days | 8 days |",
